    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420180/extras/d58b8bfa711761d3d0d0082b1e370037.avif?t=1739893893\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into a universe where love blooms across the stars. Fall in love with 8 hentai girls. Evolve your romance, make your own decisions, date, make love and lose yourself in vibrant visuals. Every solved puzzle reveals a piece of the story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This puzzle video game blends satisfying puzzles with visual storytelling. Experience eight unique characters, each presenting a beautifully crafted love story. As you progress, solve puzzles to unlock new chapters, make meaningful choices in the narrative, and collect stunning artwork in the in-game gallery. Relax to a soothing lofi music player, enchanting the atmosphere of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420180/extras/bf5c1882fe44f3430eb61f9fb8992444.avif?t=1739893893\" data-has-big width=800 height=292 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80 Levels</strong>: Explore a diverse array of visual and thematic challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80 Achievements</strong>: Get them all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Puzzle types</strong>: Enjoy match puzzles, rotation puzzles and swap puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery</strong>: Unlock and revisit beautiful illustrations from the game's stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Solve button</strong>: For when you need a helping hand to keep the story moving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple choices</strong>: Shape the direction of each love story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom mode</strong>: Set your own difficulty and play random puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lo-Fi music player</strong>: Chill out with calming tracks that enhance the immersive atmosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
